cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these data, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "WinAPIReplay"
abstract: >-
  WinAPIReplay re-executes each call recorded in a Windows API-call log as a real
  operating-system call, without the malware binary, using a unified handle map for
  cross-layer (Win32 and NT-native) handle chains and a three-tier sandbox that
  confines every side effect to disposable places. This repository contains the
  re-execution tool, the API signature database, the conversion and evaluation
  scripts, the SHA-256 identifiers of the 500 analysed traces, and the processed
  result files that support the figures and tables of the paper.
